  Icon: {fileID: -5584597377586249350, guid: dd17483c8599949439aa76bc97f7f099, type: 3}
  Color: {r: 0.9215687, g: 0.9215687, b: 0.94117653, a: 1}
  Content: "\"Moloch\u2019s Mosquito\"\nMatthew Charbonneau\nA scrap-metal sculpture
    that critiques overconsumption and extraction, drawing parallels between human
    impact and the mosquito's deadly reach. A stark reminder of how small acts can
    multiply into planetary harm.\n\n\"Radio Free Arts Fest!\"\nPeter Menzies + Guests\nA
    live radio broadcast covering festival highlights, artist interviews, and spontaneous
    conversations with attendees. Includes trivia and music from insect-themed bands
    like The Beatles and Bee Gees.\"\n"
  RavenSucessScript: "\u201CScrap metal bites, radio sings, and the bugs? They\u2019ve
    got rhythm. You\u2019ve tuned into Dawson\u2019s oddest frequency\u2014nice catch!\u201D"
  RavenHintScript: 
